#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:10
msgid "MCUboot control and Flash composition"
msgstr "MCUboot 控制与 Flash 装配"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:12
msgid ""
"The stateless control API and concrete Flash composition have separate "
"responsibilities. Products own authentication policy, image regions, reset "
"and recovery decisions."
msgstr "无状态控制 API 与具体 Flash 装配职责独立。产品负责认证策略、镜像区域、复位和恢复决策。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:16
msgid "MCUboot control and explicit Flash composition"
msgstr "MCUboot 控制与显式 Flash 装配"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:18
msgid ""
"`Nexus::MCUBootControl` exposes the stateless public control API below. It "
"uses only Nexus types. `Nexus::MCUBootPort` is the separate, concrete Flash "
"composition boundary; `Nexus::MCUBootBootStorage` belongs to a separately "
"linked boot image. These targets are outside the default platform assembly."
msgstr ""
"`Nexus::MCUBootControl` 暴露下述无状态公共控制 API，仅使用 Nexus 类型。`Nexus::MCUBootPort` "
"是独立的具体 Flash 装配边界；`Nexus::MCUBootBootStorage` 属于独立链接的 boot 镜像。这些 target "
"均不属于默认平台装配。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:23
msgid ""
"Use the [canonical MCUboot contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/protocols/mcuboot/README.md) for helper selection, the "
"boot/application ownership diagram, finite operation and Flash-region "
"lifetime, partial persistent writes and product recovery duties. The "
"overwrite-only profile supports permanent requests and has no rollback. The "
"separate [scratch-swap profile](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/protocols/mcuboot/swap/README.md) adds TEST, explicit "
"confirmation and unconfirmed revert using real upstream bootutil. Neither "
"control API authenticates a candidate or resets hardware; the separately "
"linked boot image owns verification and exchange. The product owns the "
"decision to accept, execute and confirm an image."
msgstr ""
"helper 选择、boot／应用所有权图、有限操作与 Flash region 生命周期、部分持久化写入及产品恢复责任见[权威 MCUboot "
"合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/protocols/mcuboot/README.md)。overwrite-only profile "
"只支持永久请求，不提供回退。独立的 [scratch-swap profile](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/protocols/mcuboot/swap/README.md)复用真实上游 bootutil，增加 "
"TEST、显式确认及未确认回退。两种控制 API 均不认证候选或复位硬件；独立链接的 boot 镜像拥有验证与交换。产品决定是否接受、执行和确认镜像。"

