#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:40
msgid ""
"Use `nexus_add_mcuboot_swap_control()` for application control and "
"`nexus_add_mcuboot_swap_boot()` for the independent boot profile. CMake "
"rejects mixing overwrite and swap in one final consumer; separate "
"executables may select different profiles in the same build graph. Public "
"types and operation scopes remain separate so an overwrite consumer does not"
" acquire scratch storage."
msgstr ""
"应用控制使用 `nexus_add_mcuboot_swap_control()`，独立 boot profile 使用 "
"`nexus_add_mcuboot_swap_boot()`。CMake 拒绝在同一最终消费者中混链 overwrite 和 "
"swap；同一构建图中的不同 executable 可以选择不同 profile。公共类型和操作 scope 保持分离，overwrite 消费者不承担"
" scratch 存储。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:46
msgid ""
"Every Flash operation uses the caller's stable explicit "
"region/clock/deadline scope through the entire call. A failed request or "
"confirmation may already have persistent effects; do not retry blindly, "
"extend the old deadline or infer rollback from an error. A TEST request is "
"not automatic confirmation. Confirm only after the product validates the "
"actual running image and its health. On F407, single-bank program/erase can "
"stall instruction fetch and IRQ service; the operation deadline cannot "
"preempt a physical programming pulse."
msgstr ""
"完整 Flash 调用始终使用调用者稳定且显式的 region／clock／deadline "
"scope。请求或确认失败可能已产生持久作用；不得盲目重试、延长旧 deadline 或从错误推断写入已回滚。TEST "
"请求不自动确认；产品验证实际运行镜像及其健康后才允许确认。F407 单 bank 写擦可能停顿取指与 IRQ service；操作 deadline "
"无法抢占物理编程脉冲。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:54
msgid ""
"The reviewed F407ZG swap reference reserves 128 KiB boot, two 384 KiB image "
"slots and 128 KiB scratch in 1 MiB internal Flash. Its shared layout file "
"owns linker and region geometry; do not copy those addresses to another part"
" or existing product layout. Exact model interruption and ARM-linked image "
"budgets do not establish physical Flash, endurance, power-cut or HIL "
"qualification."
msgstr ""
"已审 F407ZG swap 参考在 1 MiB 内部 Flash 中预留 128 KiB boot、两个 384 KiB 镜像槽及 128 KiB "
"scratch。共享布局文件拥有链接与 region 几何；不要把这些地址复制到其他器件或已有产品布局。精确模型中断和 ARM 链接镜像预算不建立物理 "
"Flash、耐久、掉电或 HIL 资格。"

