msgid "mcuboot_swap_control.h"
msgstr "mcuboot_swap_control.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:70
msgid "Explicit single-image MCUboot scratch trial/confirm control."
msgstr "显式单镜像 MCUboot scratch 试运行／确认控制。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:70
msgid "Author  Nexus Team"
msgstr "作者 Nexus Team"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:70
msgid "Observe the selected scratch profile's next boot action."
msgstr "观察选定 scratch profile 的下次启动动作。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:70
msgid ""
"Task/boot context, serialized by the product. The immutable three-area "
"operation, regions, clock and provider live for the entire call. NONE is not"
" image authenticity or media health; pinned upstream may treat unreadable "
"secondary metadata as empty. No allocation, worker or hardware start."
msgstr ""
"由产品串行化的任务／boot 上下文。不可变三 area 操作、region、clock 与 provider 在完整调用期间保持有效。NONE "
"不证明镜像真实性或介质健康；锁定上游可能把不可读的 secondary 元数据当作空槽。不分配、不建 worker、不启动硬件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:70
msgid "[out] Separate result, unchanged on rejection/error."
msgstr "[out] 独立结果，拒绝／错误时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:70
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or IO for unknown/PANIC/read error."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID，或未知／PANIC／读错误对应的 IO。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:70
msgid "Request a trial or permanent scratch swap via upstream API."
msgstr "通过上游 API 请求试运行或永久 scratch 交换。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:70
msgid ""
"Same immutable operation and finite deadline as query. TEST requires "
"explicit application confirmation after a successful boot, otherwise next "
"boot reverts. Product owns candidate authentication, health, authorization "
"and reset. No request validates the image or renews the deadline."
msgstr ""
"使用与 query 相同的不可变操作及有限 deadline。TEST "
"在成功启动后需要应用显式确认，否则下一次启动回退。产品拥有候选认证、健康、授权及复位策略。请求不验证镜像，也不续期 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:70
msgid "[in] TEST or PERMANENT; unknown values reject."
msgstr "[in] TEST 或 PERMANENT；拒绝未知值。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:70
msgid ""
"SUCCESS only after matching action readback; IO or STATE may follow partial "
"persistent trailer modification."
msgstr "只在动作读回匹配后返回 SUCCESS；IO 或 STATE 之前可能已部分修改持久化 trailer。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:70
msgid "Observe the primary trailer's confirmation flag."
msgstr "观察 primary trailer 的确认标志。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:70
msgid ""
"Serialized finite operation; this is a trailer observation, not health, "
"executable identity or physical boot evidence."
msgstr "串行有限操作；这里只观察 trailer，不证明健康、执行镜像身份或物理启动。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:70
msgid "[out] Written only for a valid SET/UNSET flag."
msgstr "[out] 仅对合法 SET／UNSET 标志写入结果。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:70
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE for corrupt flag, or IO."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、损坏标志对应的 STATE，或 IO。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:70
msgid "Confirm the current primary through the official API."
msgstr "通过官方 API 确认当前 primary。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:70
msgid ""
"Product authorizes this only after its health checks and exact running-image"
" identification. No automatic confirm, reset, replay, Flash rollback or "
"deadline renewal occurs."
msgstr "产品仅在健康检查和精确运行镜像身份核对完成后授权调用。不自动确认、复位、重放、回滚 Flash 或续期 deadline。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/boot.md:70
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after SET readback, STATE or IO; partial persistent effects remain "
"possible on failure."
msgstr "SET 读回后返回 SUCCESS，或返回 STATE／IO；失败仍可能有部分持久化作用。"
